# ── 1. DATA & RAW LOGS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Bulk text/CSV data dumps generated by CSI collection & training runs.
# Re-include essential documentation that shares these extensions.
*.txt
*.csv
*.log
*.dat
*.tsv
*.npy
*.npz
*.pkl
*.pickle
*.parquet

# Safeguard: keep all markdown docs + license tracked
!README.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!ARCHITECTURE.md
!CLAUDE.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
!LICENSE.md

